      ],
      "text": "Website tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        84.81104278564453,
        112.94929504394531,
        104.31244659423828
      ],
      "text": "PART 3\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        118.65204620361328,
        128.42164611816406,
        138.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        138.75469970703125,
        508.889404296875,
        177.47360229492188
      ],
      "text": "Shall we go through the notes we've made from our research into loneliness\nnow, Dev?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        190.29205322265625,
        99.86299896240234,
        209.79345703125
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        210.2747039794922,
        521.45458984375,
        248.9925994873047
      ],
      "text": "OK, Tamara. It’s been a real eye-opener. I had no idea that loneliness has been\nincreasing steadily for the last 20 years.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        261.9320373535156,
        128.42164611816406,
        281.4334411621094
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        281.9146728515625,
        480.17401123046875,
        320.63360595703125
      ],
      "text": "I know. And it's the same all over the world. The downside of a modern\nlifestyle, I guess.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        333.4520263671875,
        99.86299896240234,
        352.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        353.5536804199219,
        520.1036376953125,
        372.35260009765625
      ],
      "text": "Did you come to any conclusions about what the reasons for the increase are?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        385.29205322265625,
        128.42164611816406,
        404.79345703125
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        405.2746887207031,
        470.01263427734375,
        443.87359619140625
      ],
      "text": "Well, I'd assumed it was mainly an issue for the elderly, but in fact it's\nsomething which affects young people just as much.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        456.81103515625,
        99.86299896240234,
        476.31243896484375
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        476.9146728515625,
        514.3099975585938,
        515.5136108398438
      ],
      "text": "So nothing really to do with longer lifespans. What about social media? In my\ncase, far from making me feel isolated, it actually does the opposite, it?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        528.4520263671875,
        128.42164611816406,
        547.9534301757812
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        548.4346923828125,
        513.2944946289062,
        607.0736083984375
      ],
      "text": "It definitely does more good than harm. I'd say loneliness has a lot to do with\nthe way cities are designed. People living in high flats with not much\nopportunity to speak to their neighbours.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        619.8920288085938,
        99.86299896240234,
        639.3934326171875
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        639.8746948242188,
        168.53927612304688,
        658.673583984375
      ],
      "text": "I think you right.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        671.6110229492188,
        128.42164611816406,
        691.1124267578125
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        691.7147216796875,
        500.4126892089844,
        730.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Another possible reason is that people are having fewer children and don’t\nlive in large extended family groups.\n"
    }
  ]
